     A**
     A** PAYEE HISTORY FILE
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PPH01                     TEXT('PAYEE HISTORY LOG FILE')
     A            PHCO#          3P 0       COLHDG('COMPANY')
     A            PHFEIN         9P 0       COLHDG('FEDERAL ID#')
     A            PHMOD          3P 0       COLHDG('MODIFIER')
     A            PHDESC        40A         COLHDG('FIELD')
     A            PHFVAL        40A         COLHDG('FROM VALUE')
     A            PHTVAL        40A         COLHDG('TO VALUE')
     A            PHUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            PHDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A            PHTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
